msgid "A noun’s cases on the tray: tap a form to hear it, its ending lit. Question words can head the rows, and one row or column can be tinted. On a phone the rows stack."
msgstr "A noun’s cases on the tray: tap a form to hear it, its ending lit. Question words can head the rows, and one row or column can be tinted. On a phone the rows stack."

